{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "d740835b51cc68031d0e5359e739dec47d728b66634315ceda79ffa1425fedc5", "ja": "はぁ……どうしよう。大変だけど、長いほうが……。\nううん、やっぱり短いほうがわかりやすいかな……？", "zh": "唉……怎么办。虽然会累，但长一点比较好……\n不，果然还是短一点比较好理解吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1001_p", "source_sha256": "829d5e6f09fa90d98a3ff463e5e161dd1e1436e5421817fc4db5e1c41fdc83a8", "ja": "百合子、どうかしたのか？\nさっきからため息なんかついて……。", "zh": "百合子，怎么了吗？\n看你从刚才开始就一直在叹气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "5241b20458e801b35c5a19f878fa39442b122251365e41a1e481f9436bc35aa7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n実は今、すごく悩んでいることがあって……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n其实我现在有件事很烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "be2d39bb8ab4426fc53e389de1d3874c49b1b7b7d25de5df7201a1cd0548aded", "ja": "今度、劇場のみんなと合宿に行きますよね？\n何を持っていったらいいのか、困ってるんです！", "zh": "下次剧场的伙伴们不是要一起去集训吗？\n我在烦恼要带什么去才好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "8e7da9fd4eb8153fa9497594d0ceb337609217823fb8f91688e9b668dbbe7610", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n相談に乗ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我可以找你商量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5930dfcb6f228715ce06b9759cae62f4cff2d0c06f374abc2c216bc4119a41b5", "ja": "いいけど、そんなに悩むほどのことか？\n着替えと水着と洗面用具と、あとは……。", "zh": "可以是可以，但有需要那么烦恼吗？\n要带的不是就换洗衣物、泳装、清洁保养用品，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "0b7a8beeae6bc53552580b0f964add57b558f9f1f4b29fa6d00cb9d86ae8bc6b", "ja": "あっ、そうじゃなくて！　ええと……\n実は、一緒に持っていく本について悩んでたんです。", "zh": "啊，不是那样的！就是……\n其实我是在烦恼要一起带去的书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1007_p", "source_sha256": "93fc2361c3a32dd9a5a77418938a0e5412d10d6d1f694e2994411355644c5a95", "ja": "合宿に持っていく……本？", "zh": "要带去集训的……书？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "8f9c57449a1dde8dbe6923bc6f70c0df8eadb4f35198fe639da4f3ec984d226f", "ja": "はい！　夜はみんなとお泊りですから、この機会に\nじっくりと本の魅力を伝えたいな、と思って！", "zh": "是的！因为晚上会跟大家一起过夜，\n我想趁这个机会好好传达书的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "9b07b2058cd3eb4de78d244e8c718ddf8d7229dfbd2eede7c56a6ca9bd2dca73", "ja": "けど、長編は合宿中に読めないかもしれないし。短編の\nほうがいいかな？とか考えてたら、キリがなくて……。", "zh": "不过，长篇的书在集训期间可能看不完，\n所以我在犹豫短篇会不会比较好，结果就没完没了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cb4af2de224780970aa137b5962c243f4a1c301936c91216c0abd3363018d5d7", "ja": "百合子らしいな……。けど、せっかくの海なんだから\nアウトドアを楽しんだほうがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "真像百合子会做的事呢……但难得要去海边，\n多玩一些户外活动不是比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "110d891918035ea069027549ee4424fb49f08f69bad941d131b9815b957222e8", "ja": "それはもちろん！　合宿をより楽しむために、\n周辺の観光ガイドも準備しましたから♪", "zh": "那当然！为了能让集训更开心，\n我还准备了那附近的观光导览手册♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8d17e6af32220fcc2f99962e4aa96608de394e1c98cd4edfb567f6b5fc0238ac", "ja": "ならいいけど。じゃあ、本のテーマを絞って……\n夏を描いた本を1冊、とかにするのはどうだ？", "zh": "那就好。不然就先锁定书的主题……\n像是一本描写夏天的书，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "b1d39cdfeb61a1a2d7d2dcdf3e2ba38b21bb70b1a8ae4b560c356af66007c7e4", "ja": "あっ、なるほど！　本のテーマを決めれば、\nさらに絞り込みやすくなりますね！", "zh": "啊，原来如此！\n先决定书的主题，就会更好筛选了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "053136d977cdbe54fc153ee314ef5102e24864254051f2b308b16064f31da7dd", "ja": "夏がテーマ……となると、あれしかありませんね！\nでも、う～ん……。", "zh": "以夏天为主题……既然如此，就只有那本了呢！\n可是，唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1015_p", "source_sha256": "624c6ba1b2ccf8445fcbc04ef00605c8abb38b03955632f2eb4cb04e4e0d1faf", "ja": "今度はなんだ？", "zh": "这次又怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "9d3d31c3f41baf50a36d7d410610204fde10fff48a447b3b0e3f8c4ada0dddab", "ja": "短編はいいんですけど、長編が全20巻あって……\nバッグが本でいっぱいで、荷物が入らないかも……。", "zh": "短篇倒是没问题，但长篇总共有20集……\n背包里可能会塞满书，装不进行李……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "e8d6ff944de45ec287a5b10a9a65ce0482e3dcdb6009c77ecd6d8db3f6adb79f", "ja": "でも、せっかくだから全巻持っていきたいし……。\nこうなったら、大きいバッグに買い替えるしか……！", "zh": "不过难得有这个机会，我又想全套带去……\n既然如此，只好买更大的背包了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0063_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6132f7625acee82c3edd61c752d80395fdde22a8df3c388d81d584153fda1a74", "ja": "いや、最初の1冊だけでいいと思うぞ……というか、\nせっかくの海水浴なんだから、読書はほどほどにな！", "zh": "不用啦，我觉得带开头第1集去就好了……\n话说，难得去海水浴场，别太沉浸于阅读喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
